# Gradle
#
# Gradle output is matched by position, never as a bare `build/`. An unanchored pattern also
# matches the Java package `gov/niemplatform/build/`, which silently excluded the entire canonical
# code generator from the repository -- a clone that cannot build, failing with "plugin
# implementation class not found", which points nowhere near the cause. The same mistake is
# documented for .dockerignore in CLAUDE.md; it was live here too.
.gradle/
/build
/*/build
/*/*/build
/*/*/*/build
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
out/

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Local runtime state -- bronze/silver/gold data produced by local runs is never committed.
/local-data/
/var/

# Zen sidecar working directory (generated test reports, index cache).
.zen/
